      "content": "i tried elevating it for a bit but it isnt doing much. i really dont want to spend all night in an er waiting room. if i just take some extra ibuprofen or maybe some aspirin to see if that helps the swelling and the tightness, would that be okay? i usually take 400mg for headaches but maybe i should take more to really get it under control since im in discomfort?",
